{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "50bd5418-3dd7-8659-9a78-f5fca6ae3338",
  "created_at": "2026-02-23T11:51:56-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Dennis Brennan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Tony Ferreira",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:49:27-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Tony. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:49:32-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, I'm renting a place and my landlord says the water bill is mine, and I just want to know whose it actually is, because, um, I never got one in my name."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:49:46-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. In general the water and sewer bill goes to the property owner, since the account is tied to the property. A landlord can pass it along to a tenant in a lease, but that's between the two of you. The city bills the owner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:50:04-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so the city bill isn't mine, it's his, and whether I pay him is a lease thing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:50:12-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, that's the plain version. Your lease should say who covers water."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:50:17-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Could you, um, put that in writing? Like the explanation, in an email or something."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:50:24-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can send you a short note saying the bill is issued to the owner of record. What email should I use?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:50:33-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll give it to you, yeah, but also can I get a duplicate copy of the bill emailed? The landlord gave me a, uh, a picture of it but it's cut off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:50:46-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can do that. I'll send a duplicate of the current bill with the note. Go ahead with the email."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:50:54-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, it's actually, hold on. [pause] Never mind, you can send it to the one on my account request, I'll just, um. Actually, the amount is forty-eight fifty, right? The one in the picture?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:51:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the balance showing is forty-eight dollars and fifty cents."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:51:13-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'll just pay it, then. It's not worth a fight with him over the money. Can I do a credit card now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:51:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can take that over the phone. Go ahead whenever you're ready."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:51:28-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 6011 1111 1111 1117, expiration 03/28."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:51:31-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 6011 1111 1111 1117, expires 03/28, for forty-eight fifty. I'll run that now. [pause] That went through. You'll get a receipt with the duplicate."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:51:42-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great, thanks. Sorry, what was your name again? I want to write it down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:51:48-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tony, T-O-N-Y, Ferreira, F-E-R-R-E-I-R-A."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:51:50-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tony Ferreira. Okay, thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T11:51:53-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
